flowchart TD
    Start([Slot becomes free]) --> FreeEvent[POST /slots/freed or webhook]
    FreeEvent --> Engine[Queue engine tryNotifyNext]
    Engine --> Peek[Peek first waiting or skipped entry]
    Peek --> Empty{Queue empty?}

    Empty -->|Yes| WaitMore([Wait for next slot or enqueue])
    Empty -->|No| Notify[Mark entry notified — send WhatsApp SMS App]
    Notify --> Timer[Schedule BullMQ claim timer 50s]
    Timer --> Check{WhatsApp confirm received?}

    Check -->|Yes in time| Confirm[queue.claim.confirmed]
    Confirm --> Assign[Pop entry — assign slot — clear plate lock]
    Assign --> Success([Slot assigned — done])

    Check -->|No — timeout| Timeout[queue.claim.timeout]
    Timeout --> Shift[Shift entry back N positions]
    Shift --> Note[N grows with consecutive misses per slot]
    Note --> ReNotify[tryNotifyNext same slot — next FIFO head]
    ReNotify --> Peek
